[Icon Theme]
Name=SlideAnnouncerBlank
Comment=The entire Adwaita cursor set, copied in fresh at build time, with only cursors/default overwritten by a transparent 1x1 image — Adwaita's own left_ptr/top_left_arrow/arrow/move/dnd-move are symlinks to default already, so this blanks all of them for free without touching anything else. A name this theme doesn't define at all renders as nothing rather than a visible fallback, which is why the real set is copied wholesale instead of hand-picking names.
